1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,500
Good morning, and welcome
to the coastal train.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,200
This train calls at all stations
to the harbour.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,000
The bakery car is open
at the front of the train.

4
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:13,000
The next stop is Milbrook.

5
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:16,000
Please take all your bags
when you leave the train.

6
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Tickets are on sale in coach three. Cards and coins are fine.

7
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,000
We expect a short delay at the bridge.

8
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:26,500
Thank you.

9
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,500
Rain is likley later today.

10
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:33,000
<i>Mind the gap.</i>

11
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:36,500
Bicycles go in the last coach,
next to the luggage rack.

12
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:39,000
The harbour is the last stop.

13
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Have a pleasant trip.

